@startuml
!theme plain
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
title Provider-neutral Payment Processing — HLD (Educational Reference)
actor Customer
component "Merchant Checkout" as Merchant
package "Payment Platform" {
 component "API Gateway" as Gateway
 component "Payment Orchestrator" as Orch
 component "Processor Adapter" as Adapter
 component "Callback Receiver" as CB
 component "Recovery Worker" as Recover
 component "Merchant Webhook / Outbox" as Outbox
 component "Reconciliation" as Recon
 database "Intent & Attempt Store" as Store
 database "Ledger / Audit" as Ledger
}
cloud "External Processor" as Processor
component "Payer Bank / Payment Rail" as Bank
Customer --> Merchant : checkout
Merchant --> Gateway : create/query intent
Gateway --> Orch : validated request
Orch --> Store : create/transition state
Orch --> Adapter : submit attempt
Adapter --> Processor : provider request
Processor --> Bank : authorization / execution
Processor ..> CB : verified status event
CB --> Store : idempotent transition
CB --> Outbox : durable outcome event
Outbox ..> Merchant : merchant webhook
Recover ..> Processor : status enquiry (ambiguity)
Recover --> Store : reconcile attempt state
Recon ..> Processor : external report/status
Recon --> Ledger : investigate variances
Orch --> Ledger : business events / audit
note bottom of Store
Merchant order, payment intent and payment attempt
are separate linked entities.
Unknown outcome is not a financial decline.
end note
@enduml